# Rust / Cargo (Tauri desktop) — target/ is the build output. Cargo.lock
# IS committed because helm-desktop is a binary crate (we want reproducible builds).
# tauri's gen/ dir is regenerated by tauri-build at compile time.
**/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/

